00:04:25.175 --> 00:04:28.235
of people thought that the people who were passing by were doing so

00:04:28.235 --> 00:04:31.425
because they were afraid of getting into trouble if anyone stopped to help.

00:04:31.425 --> 00:04:33.935
So it seems that the opening premise of the

00:04:33.935 --> 00:04:36.265
Incredibles woulld just fall apart, since

00:04:36.265 --> 00:04:39.315
Mr. Incredible would be protected by Good Samaritan Laws in saving people.

00:04:39.315 --> 00:04:41.625
But there are a couple wrinkles here that might

